  <div data-view="about" hidden>
    <header class="w ch"><span class="tag">About</span>
      <h1 class="grad">Builder at heart. Strategist by instinct. Leader by experience.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I’m Drake, a senior product manager based in Charlotte, NC. I like owning the hard part of a product and working close to the engineers who build it. Former digital nomad, digital privacy advocate, PMP and CSPO.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="w sec">
